<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>07 / 试卷与生涯</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>知识理解专项测评：独立于套路通过率</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={700} height={330} viewBox='0 0 700 330'><rect x='0' y='0' width='345' height='36' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='172.5' y='24' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>任务类型</text><rect x='345' y='0' width='345' height='36' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='517.5' y='24' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>考查什么</text><rect x='0' y='36' width='345' height='58' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='172.5' y='70.0' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>解释概念含义</text><rect x='345' y='36' width='345' height='58' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='517.5' y='70.0' font-size='17' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>用自己的话说出定义与意义</text><rect x='0' y='94' width='345' height='58' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='172.5' y='128.0' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>判断公式 / 定理适用条件</text><rect x='345' y='94' width='345' height='58' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='517.5' y='128.0' font-size='17' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>识别何时可以用、何时不能用</text><rect x='0' y='152' width='345' height='58' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='172.5' y='186.0' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>区分相近概念</text><rect x='345' y='152' width='345' height='58' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='517.5' y='186.0' font-size='17' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>辨析易混淆的边界</text><rect x='0' y='210' width='345' height='58' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='172.5' y='244.0' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>寻找反例</text><rect x='345' y='210' width='345' height='58' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='517.5' y='244.0' font-size='17' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>构造使结论不成立的情形</text><rect x='0' y='268' width='345' height='58' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='172.5' y='302.0' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>构造满足条件的例子</text><rect x='345' y='268' width='345' height='58' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='517.5' y='302.0' font-size='17' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>从条件反向生成对象</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>测评设计</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>独立于套路通过率，避免把“会做某类题”直接等同于“理解了概念”。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>关联知识点、可观察目标与可接受的不同回答。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>开放回答保留教师复核入口。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>试卷变容易或 AI 帮助增加导致的分数提高，不应直接解释为能力提高。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：试卷与生涯维度设计思路.md §8.1</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 74 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>